        "<b>Fungi</b>: eukaryotes with chitin walls and ergosterol membranes; yeasts and molds.",
        "<b>Gram-positive</b> = thick peptidoglycan, purple. <b>Gram-negative</b> = thin wall plus outer membrane with endotoxin, pink.",
