        "<b>Endemic</b> = baseline presence; <b>epidemic</b> = above expected; <b>pandemic</b> = worldwide spread.",
        "<b>Primary</b> prevention stops disease before it starts; <b>secondary</b> detects early; <b>tertiary</b> limits disability.",
        "<b>Zoonoses</b>: animal-to-human infections (Lyme, rabies). Vectors shift with climate.",
        "Environmental exposures: particulate air pollution, lead, heat, occupational load and vibration.",
        "<b>Social determinants</b>: income, education, housing, access to care shape exposure and outcomes."
